/events/invitee/access/show, to `going` registrants), no counts of invitations and no other invitee (VTI-PEV-041).","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["eventId","host","kind","status","title","when","registration","roster","sequence"],"properties":{"eventId":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventId"},"host":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/VtaEventDid"},"kind":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventKind"},"status":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventLifecycle"},"title":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventTitle"},"description":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventDescription"},"when":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/When"},"placeSummary":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/PlaceSummary"},"registration":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/RegistrationSettings"},"roster":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/VtaEventRoster"},"suggestedReminderMinutes":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/VtaEventReminderList"},"full":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when no place is free. Never the count itself."},"sequence":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"cancelReason":{"type":"string","maxLength":500}}},"VtaEventReminderList":{"title":"VtaEventReminderList","description":"Reminder offsets the host suggests, in minutes before the start, distinct. The invitee\'s own VTA decides whether to use them (VTI-CAL-041).","type":"array","maxItems":4,"uniqueItems":true,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/ReminderMinutes"}},"ReminderMinutes":{"title":"ReminderMinutes","description":"A reminder\'s offset: how many minutes before the event\'s start it is due. At most four weeks.","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":40320},"RegistrationSettings":{"title":"RegistrationSettings","description":"How the event takes registrations (VTI-EVT-031 – 036).","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["mode"],"properties":{"mode":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/RegistrationMode"},"capacity":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100000,"description":"The most people who may be going, plus-ones included. Absent means no limit."},"waitlist":{"type":"boolean","description":"Registrations beyond `capacity` are waitlisted, and the first on the waitlist becomes going when a place frees (VTI-EVT-033). Absent means false: a registration beyond capacity is refused."},"plusOnes":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":10,"description":"The most guests a registrant may bring. Absent means 0."},"opensAt":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventInstant","description":"Registrations are refused before this. Absent means from publication."},"closesAt":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventInstant","description":"Registrations and changes are refused after this, except withdrawal (VTI-EVT-037). Absent means at the event\'s start."},"questions":{"type":"array","maxItems":20,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/RegistrationQuestion"}},"codeOfConduct":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/CodeOfConduct"}}},"CodeOfConduct":{"title":"CodeOfConduct","description":"A code of conduct a registrant acknowledges before the registration is accepted (VTI-EVT-035). `sha256` pins the text acknowledged.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["url","sha256"],"properties":{"url":{"type":"string","format":"uri","maxLength":2048,"pattern":"^https://"},"sha256":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}\$"}}},"RegistrationQuestion":{"title":"RegistrationQuestion","description":"A question a registrant answers when registering. Answers are read by the event\'s hosts only, and are deleted on the event\'s retention schedule (VTI-EVT-034, VTI-EVT-090).","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["questionId","label","kind"],"properties":{"questionId":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/RegistrationQuestionId"},"label":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200,"description":"The question as shown. Plain text."},"kind":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/RegistrationQuestionKind"},"choices":{"type":"array","minItems":2,"maxItems":20,"uniqueItems":true,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"description":"Present exactly when `kind` is `choice`."},"required":{"type":"boolean","description":"The registration is refused without an answer. Absent means false."}}},"RegistrationQuestionKind":{"title":"RegistrationQuestionKind","type":"string","enum":["text","choice","boolean"],"description":"`text`: a free answer of at most 500 characters. `choice`: one of `choices`. `boolean`: yes or no."},"RegistrationMode":{"title":"RegistrationMode","description":"`open`: a member of the audience who registers is going at once (or waitlisted when full). `approval`: a registration is pending until a host decides it. `closed`: no registrations; the event is for information only (VTI-EVT-031).","type":"string","enum":["open","approval","closed"]},"PlaceSummary":{"title":"PlaceSummary","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200,"description":"A coarse hint shown with the event to its whole audience — `Central London`, `Online` — never the address. Plain text."},"When":{"title":"When","description":"When the event happens, in JSCalendar\'s terms. `start` is local time in `timeZone`; `duration` is how long it lasts. With `showWithoutTime` true it is an all-day event: `start`\'s time MUST be `T00:00:00` and `duration` whole days (VTI-EVT-005).","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["start","timeZone","duration"],"properties":{"start":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/LocalDateTime"},"timeZone":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/TimeZoneId"},"duration":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/JSCalendarDuration"},"showWithoutTime":{"type":"boolean","description":"An all-day event. Absent means false."}}},"JSCalendarDuration":{"title":"JSCalendarDuration","description":"A non-negative duration in the subset of ISO 8601 JSCalendar uses: `P` then weeks or days, then `T` with hours, minutes and seconds, such as `PT1H30M`, `P1D` or `P2W`. No months or years. Used only for `When.duration`, which carries JSCalendar\'s own member and encoding verbatim; this family\'s own offsets are integers naming their unit (`ReminderMinutes`).","type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":32,"pattern":"^P(?!\$)([0-9]+W)?([0-9]+D)?(T(?=[0-9])([0-9]+H)?([0-9]+M)?([0-9]+S)?)?\$"},"TimeZoneId":{"title":"TimeZoneId","description":"An IANA 